id: FEND4-3
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: no_hidden_triggers
target: crates/web/src/host.rs
find:             el("div", vec![("data-testid", "workshop-parts")], parts),
replace:             el("div", vec![("data-testid", "workshop-parts")], parts),            el("button", vec![("data-testid", "tick-trigger"), ("data-action", "tick"), ("data-payload", ""), ("hidden", "")], vec![]),
expect-fail: 実ソースは違反なし
note: 配信する設定に、進行の宛先を data-payload で届ける隠し要素が入る（FEND-4 が禁じる経路）
